1. `yaml.Unmarshal(data, &map[string]interface{}{})` → if error, then
2. `yaml.Unmarshal(data, &[]interface{}{})` → if error → return "unable to unmarshal array %s: %w"?

But for the YAML case the error message has NO "unable to unmarshal array" prefix! Compare:
