   var v interface{}
   err := yaml.Unmarshal([]byte(in), &v)  // generic
   ...
}
```
Hmm, with yaml.Unmarshal into interface{} and content "hello\n" → v = "hello" (a string) → no error. So that wouldn't produce this error.

So the flow must be map-first. Let me hypothesize gomplate v4's data.YAML:

```go
